abstract: >-
  Research artifact for the manuscript "DOCAR: A Domain Ontology Construction and Reasoning
  Method Combined with Large Language Models". It contains the prototype system, the simulated
  domain relational database and news corpus used in Section 5.1, and the scripts reproducing
  the experiments of Section 5.
